// Trigger Surface Learned Highlight patch - experimental runtime mask learner
//
// Learns terrain/surface masks from active SCR bytecode and opcode 0x61 runtime
// checks, then recolors PSM2 terrain primitives whose Section D flags overlap
// the learned mask union. This is a separate experiment from
// trigger_surface_highlight.pnach.
//
// Hooks:
//   0x00200844: main frame FUN_00268270 call -> frame_hook
//   0x0022C3A0: PSM2 loader FUN_00211230 call -> map_load_hook
//   0x0025B5F8: FUN_0025b390 return -> script_return_hook
//   0x0025F4D4: FUN_0025f4b8 expression eval call -> checker_expr_hook
//
// Cave state, intentionally not patched as constants because PNACH code lines may
// be re-applied while the game runs:
//   0x01E00F00 learned_union
//   0x01E00F04 dirty
//   0x01E00F08 last_mask
//   0x01E00F0C hit_count
//
// scan_active_script preserves its incoming $ra in $v1 before calling
// record_mask. This avoids returning into the scanner loop after the nested JAL.
//
// Filtering: learned masks below 0x10 are ignored while recording. Once a mask
// is learned from SCR, every PSM2 primitive whose terrain flags overlap that
// learned union is highlighted. Low learned bits 0x10/0x20/0x40/0x80 keep the
// RGB/Y color coding; any higher learned bit adds magenta.
//
// This patch uses the 0x01E00000 cave and conflicts with other patches using
// that cave or the 0x00200844 main-frame hook.

// Hook 1: main-frame dirty processor
// Original at 0x00200844: 0C09A09C (jal FUN_00268270)
patch=1,EE,20200844,extended,0C780034

// Hook 2: clear learned state, rescan active SCR, and colorize before the
// PSM2 loader bakes static map packets.
// Original at 0x0022C3A0: 0C08448C (jal FUN_00211230)
patch=1,EE,2022C3A0,extended,0C780000

// Hook 3: scan active SCR after FUN_0025b390 returns
// Original at 0x0025B5F8: 03E00008 (jr ra); delay slot 27BD0130 is preserved
patch=1,EE,2025B5F8,extended,08780010

// Hook 4: record evaluated opcode-0x61 masks after FUN_0025c258
// Original at 0x0025F4D4: 0C097096 (jal FUN_0025c258); delay slot is preserved
patch=1,EE,2025F4D4,extended,0C780024

// Code cave at 0x01E00000
patch=1,EE,21E00000,extended,27BDFFE0
